ho also believe in that same  vision so whenever you're doing your  your interviews and you're hiring you  want to make sure that they also have  that same passion of not just you know  wanting to make money everybody wants to  make money you know it's part of  survival but they want to work for your  company because they really you know  strongly believe  in your vision in my case for example I  love helping entrepreneurs and so that's  what our business is all about we love  helping entrepreneurs we try our best to  help entrepreneurs in as many ways as we  can through YouTube videos and  newsletters and content I just love you  know being able to see an entrepreneur  have a have a problem and you can help  them fix it and solve it that's what  gets me all excited and I try to bring  our people who are also excited by that  so you're coming to work for me not just  to be a marketing manager or content  writer or whatever position it is you're  coming on board because you also love  helping entrepreneurs you love  entrepreneurship even if you're not  entrepreneur yourself you just love the  world of entrepreneurs I also try to  hire people who are nice so one of the  things we look for is people who are you  got to be a nice person I think I'm a  pretty nice person and I like I found by  working with people who are not nice  that I like working with people who are  nice and i think my customers like  working with people who are nice so we  try to find people who are nice and we  put that in our job description and a  lot of people will look at that and say  they want people who are nice that  sounds so hokey pokey so Mickey Mouse  but that's fine because the people who  think that way are not going to be the  type of people who I want where the  people who see we help entrepreneurs and  we want nice people if they are you know  they love helping entrepreneurs and they  are nice they're going to say wow this  is really exciting this is a type of  place I want to be 